OL,5,GUK Weather Forecast                    
OL,7,GThis Evening and Tonight:FA few light  
OL,8,Fshowers in southwest, the north of     
OL,9,FScotland and for Irish Sea coasts.     
OL,10,FVery cold for most with a sharp frost  
OL,11,Fdeveloping, severe in places, but      
OL,12,Fmilder in the far southwest. Some      
OL,13,Fpatches of mist and freezing fog.      
OL,15,GSaturday:FFog lifting to bring long    
OL,16,Fspells of autumn sunshine in the       
OL,17,Fnorth, but cloudy intervals further    
OL,18,Fsouth and over Northern Ireland.       
OL,19,FBecoming breezy in the west this       
OL,20,Fevening. Feeling cold.                 
